    "Compare By Contents (⌥F3) needs a diff tool. Install FileMerge (part of Xcode), Kaleidoscope, or BBEdit, then reopen Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Operations footer: no diff tool installed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„Nach Inhalt vergleichen“ (⌥F3) benötigt ein Diff-Tool. Installieren Sie FileMerge (Teil von Xcode), Kaleidoscope oder BBEdit und öffnen Sie die Einstellungen erneut."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compare By Contents (⌥F3) needs a diff tool. Install FileMerge (part of Xcode), Kaleidoscope, or BBEdit, then reopen Settings."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparar por contenido (⌥F3) necesita una herramienta de comparación. Instala FileMerge (parte de Xcode), Kaleidoscope o BBEdit y vuelve a abrir Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparer par contenu (⌥F3) nécessite un outil de comparaison. Installez FileMerge (fourni avec Xcode), Kaleidoscope ou BBEdit, puis rouvrez Réglages."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Для «Сравнить по содержимому» (⌥F3) нужен инструмент сравнения. Установите FileMerge (входит в Xcode), Kaleidoscope или BBEdit, затем откройте настройки заново."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparar por Conteúdo (⌥F3) precisa de uma ferramenta de diff. Instale FileMerge (parte do Xcode), Kaleidoscope ou BBEdit, depois reabra os Ajustes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
